''Three pages. The falsifiability backbone of the entire branch. Without these, Psionic Engineering is not engineering — it is speculation with equations. Build after sufficient Branch A and D content exists to specify what is being tested.''

The derivation axiom for this branch: the ψ field equation makes specific, quantitative predictions. H₀: ψ = 0 is a formally statable null hypothesis. The test campaign is designed to distinguish genuine ψ effects from electromagnetic artifact, expectation effects, and measurement noise.

